    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49512" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θῠροκοπ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>knock at the door, break it open</i>, esp. as a
			drunken feat, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ γὰρ οἴνου γίγνεται
				καὶ θυροκοπῆσαι κτλ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1254
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυροκοπῶν ὦφλεν δἰκην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					239
				</span></i>
			, cf. Chor.in<i><span class="en">
				<u>Hermes</u>
				17.232
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>knock as at a door</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. τῇ
				χειρὶ τὴν πλευράν [τινος</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.503a
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ λιμὸς τὴν γαστέρα θ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.70
			</span></i>.</div>
